    {
     "tipo": "dialogo",
     "titulo": "Dialogue: evaluating arguments",
     "frases": [
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "林娜",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "关于「让步与对比」，你觉得哪种证据最有说服力？",
       "alumno": "About «Concession and contrast», which kind of evidence do you find most convincing?",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "王明",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "我倾向于从两个角度分析，不过两者的依据并不相同。",
       "alumno": "I lean towards analysing it from two perspectives, although their grounds are not the same.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "林娜",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "哪些证据支持这两种观点？",
       "alumno": "Which evidence supports each of these views?",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "王明",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "有些数据能说明趋势，却不能代表所有情况。",
       "alumno": "Some data show a trend, but they do not represent every case.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "林娜",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "那么结论应该怎样表述？",
       "alumno": "How, then, should the conclusion be worded?",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "王明",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "应说明目前能确认什么，也要指出仍待验证的部分。",
       "alumno": "It should say what we can confirm and point out what still needs to be verified.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "tipo": "texto",
     "titulo": "Reading: evaluating arguments",
     "frases": [
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "讨论「让步与对比」时，要区分事实、推论和个人立场。",
       "alumno": "When discussing «Concession and contrast», you must distinguish facts, inferences and personal opinions.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "说明证据的来源并回应反例，结论才更有说服力。",
       "alumno": "Explaining where the evidence comes from and responding to counterexamples strengthens the conclusion.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "评估一种方案时，应同时考虑短期效果、长期影响和执行成本。",
       "alumno": "When assessing a proposal, you must consider its short-term effects, its long-term consequences and the cost of carrying it out.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "若结果与预期不同，就要检查哪些条件没有得到充分考虑。",
       "alumno": "If the results differ from what was expected, check which conditions were not sufficiently taken into account.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "因此，结论应说明方案在哪些条件下才适用。",
       "alumno": "That is why the conclusion should explain under which conditions the proposal would apply.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
